From: jitLLM contributors
Subject: [PATCH] cuda: bound routed MMQ tails and compact expert tiles

Correct routed dummy-column padding in jitLLM's bounded workspace.
Use a device-built, bounded tile list under explicit jitLLM dispatch.
Keep raw weight strides, type-specific Q8 preparation and the existing
full-K inner product. Ordinary/reference launches default to the original
grid; no weight representation, early route weighting or sanitization.

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/mmq.cuh b/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/mmq.cuh
